{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceSubrange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subrange","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Range","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sn","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Range"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Int"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"newElements","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","preciseIdentifier":"s:s15ContiguousArrayV15replaceSubrange_4withySnySiG_qd__nt7ElementQyd__RszSlRd__lF1CL_qd__mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Sequence\/Element"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Collection","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Collection"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The subrange of the array to replace. The start and end of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a subrange must be valid indices of the array.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"subrange"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The new elements to add to the array.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"newElements"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method has the effect of removing the specified range of elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the array and inserting the new elements at the same location. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"number of new elements need not match the number of elements being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this example, three elements in the middle of an array of integers are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replaced by the five elements of a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Repeated<Int>"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[" var nums = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]"," nums.replaceSubrange(1...3, with: repeatElement(1, count: 5))"," print(nums)"," \/\/ Prints \"[10, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 50]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you pass a zero-length range as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subrange"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter, this method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inserts the elements of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"newElements"},{"type":"text","text":" at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subrange.startIndex"},{"type":"text","text":". Calling"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"insert(contentsOf:at:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method instead is preferred."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Likewise, if you pass a zero-length collection as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"newElements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter, this method removes the elements in the given subrange"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without replacement. Calling the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"removeSubrange(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method instead is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preferred."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"text":" + ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"text":" is length of the array and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"m","type":"text"}]},{"text":" is the length of ","type":"text"},{"code":"newElements","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". If the call to this method simply","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appends the contents of ","type":"text"},{"code":"newElements","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the array, this method is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"equivalent to ","type":"text"},{"code":"append(contentsOf:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ContiguousArray\/replaceSubrange(_:with:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ContiguousArray"]]},"metadata":{"title":"replaceSubrange(_:with:)","externalID":"s:s15ContiguousArrayV15replaceSubrange_4withySnySiG_qd__nt7ElementQyd__RszSlRd__lF","symbolKind":"method","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"iPadOS","unavailable